# Production frontend env. Committed on purpose: every value here is public.
# The Supabase key is a *publishable* key (sb_publishable_...), which Supabase
# designs to be readable by browsers — it is only safe because row-level
# security and the anon role restrict what it can do. The Worker URL is the
# public API address. Never put the secret/service key here.
#
# This guarantees ANY build — by anyone, on any machine — is production-correct.
# Local dev still uses .env.local, which Vite prefers in development mode.
